                                                "sense_id": "da00da27-6128-30e5-ab3d-810aa18485f6",
                                                "text": "This can be tedious, especially the minutiae of French laws and policies in Canada. When the discussion zooms in on a hot debate on raising the Franco-Ontarian flag in Sudbury, Ontario, it is hard not to feel that the topic of French in Canada has perhaps been exhausted."
